<title>UK: OFT confirms Dixons probe over retail parks.</title>
<headline>OFT confirms Dixons probe over retail parks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK Office of Fair Trading (OFT) on Tuesday confirmed it was investigating complaints that Dixons Group Plc had attempted to use its market muscle to block rivals from taking space in new retail parks.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the OFT said it had received a number of complaints and was seeking facts and views from Dixons' rivals and from property developers before deciding whether to take the issue any further.</p>
</text>
